OL,5,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,6,     FRoy chats to guest Emily Steele
OL,7,     Fabout her new play, and to Paul
OL,8,     FJones from Wrexham, who recently
OL,9,     Fwalked the Wales Coastal Path in
OL,10,     Fmemory of his wife. Plus great
OL,11,     Fstories and music.
OL,12,G1900 New Harmony: A Welshman's Dream
OL,13,     FFrom Newtown, Powys to New
OL,14,     FHarmony, Indiana - the story of
OL,15,     FWelshman Robert Owen's 'great
OL,16,     Fexperiment' seeking a socialist
OL,17,     Futopia. Colin Flynn, now a New
OL,18,     FHarmony resident, reports.
OL,19,G1929 Celebration (Evening Edition)
OL,20,     FThe Fruit of the Spirit: Self
OL,21,     FControl. A service led by the
OL,22,     FReverend Emma Ackland.
